{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02851","headline":"少年行 · 李百药","name":"少年行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年飞翠盖，上路勒金镳。\n始酌文君酒，新吹弄玉箫。\n少年不欢乐，何以尽芳朝。\n千金笑里面，一搦掌中腰。\n挂缨岂惮宿，落珥不胜娇。\n寄语少年子，无辞归路遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}